/**
 * ============================================================================
 * OmniFlow Automated Patcher — OmniFlow Red Glass Theme Bundle (Light + Dark)
 * ============================================================================
 * Zero external dependencies. Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux (Node >= 20).
 *
 * Apply patch + activate OmniFlow Red Glass on local DB (if data/omniflow-db.json exists):
 *   node omniflow-red-glass-patcher.mjs
 *
 * Apply patch without switching active local DB theme:
 *   node omniflow-red-glass-patcher.mjs --preset-only
 *
 * Dry-run preview (no files modified):
 *   node omniflow-red-glass-patcher.mjs --dry-run
 *
 * Rollback this patch completely:
 *   node omniflow-red-glass-patcher.mjs --rollback
 * ============================================================================
 */
